# Project: PrimePrep — Subject-Wise Premium Test Series Purchase and Secure Test Access

Act as a senior full-stack engineer, backend architect, payment integration specialist, and UI/UX designer. Modify my existing PrimePrep CUET PG test-series platform to implement a professional, secure, subject-wise payment and test-access system.

## 1. Primary Objective

Currently, when a student who has not purchased a test series opens a premium test, the website displays an error similar to:

"Access denied (HTTP 403). You do not have permission to perform this action."

This is not the desired student experience.

Replace this behavior with a professional purchase journey.

**Business rule: A student must purchase the complete test series for a subject to access the premium tests belonging to that subject. The student must not have to purchase each individual test separately.**

For example, if a student wants to access Political Science tests, the student should purchase the Political Science Test Series once. After the payment is successfully verified, the student should be able to access all eligible premium tests included in that subject's test series.

The same principle applies independently to Philosophy, Psychology, History, Economics, Geography, and Disaster Management.

Purchasing one subject must not automatically unlock the premium test series of another subject unless the administrator explicitly configures a separate package that includes both subjects.

