Implement this as a secure modular monolith within the existing Express backend. Do not introduce microservices unnecessarily.

Separate responsibilities using the existing project conventions. Where suitable, use modules equivalent to:

- Subject-series package management.
- Test catalogue and access control.
- Order creation.
- Razorpay integration.
- Payment verification.
- Webhook processing.
- Purchase records.
