Keep the following secrets on the backend deployment only:

- Razorpay secret key.
- Razorpay webhook secret.
- Any private database credentials.
- Other payment-related credentials.

Use appropriate environment variables in Render.

The Razorpay public key identifier may be supplied to the frontend when required by the checkout SDK, but the secret key must never be exposed in Vite environment variables or browser bundles.

